            <div xml:id="d784">

                <pb facs="0552" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg480"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Juarez to Mr. Romero</hi>.</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Extract.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-11">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 11, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Friend</hi>: * * * We also received the day
                    before yesterday the news of the total defeat of the confederate army on the 9th
                    of April. The great pleasure this news afforded us was marrred by the very sad
                    impression which the shocking intelligence of President Lincoln’s assassination
                    produced upon us. That great misfortune has profoundly impressed me, as Mr.
                    Lincoln, who worked with so much-earnestness and abnegation for the cause of
                    nationality and freedom, was worthy of a better fate than the poniard of a
                    coward assassin. I do most earnestly hope that Mr. Seward’s wounds would not be
                    mortal, and that his son, too, may have been saved. I beg of you to pay a
                    private visit to Mr. Seward in my name, expressing to him my grief for the
                    misfortunes befallen upon him, and my best wishes for his speedy and complete
                    recovery.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BENITO JUAREZ.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor <hi rendition="#small-caps">Don Matias Romero</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
